      "data": {
        "markdown": "## Contact & commercial links\n\n**Business inquiries:** [collabs.machinemommy@gmail.com](mailto:collabs.machinemommy@gmail.com)\n\n- [Official contact section](https://machine-mommy.com/#contact)\n- [Commissioned custom videos](https://machine-mommy.com/cameo.html)\n- [Merchandise](https://streamlabs.com/machine_mommy/merch)\n- [Wishlist](https://throne.com/machine_mommy)\n- [Discord](https://discord.gg/machinemommy)\n- [Cash App payment link](https://cash.app/$machinemommy)\n\nThe email and links above are presented publicly by the official site. They are recorded here as public professional contact routes, not as private biographical information."
